WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.292
The storm lasted throughout the night.

2
00:00:03.293 --> 00:00:06.397
By morning, the sun was shining again.

3
00:00:06.398 --> 00:00:09.925
Most of Dr. Dolittle’s belongings were lost.

4
00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:16.977
Fortunately, his medicine bag did not sink with the boat.

5
00:00:16.978 --> 00:00:20.367
"Are we in Africa?" asked Gub-Gub.

6
00:00:20.368 --> 00:00:23.057
He was happy to be off the boat.

7
00:00:23.058 --> 00:00:26.833
"I’m not sure," replied Dr. Dolittle.

8
00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:31.430
"Oh, my tummy," Gub-Gub cried suddenly.

9
00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:36.488
"What’s the matter, Gub-Gub?" said the doctor, worried.

10
00:00:36.489 --> 00:00:40.420
"There’s nothing wrong with him, Doc," growled Jip.

11
00:00:40.421 --> 00:00:44.828
"No! My tummy DOES hurt!" the pig moaned.

12
00:00:44.829 --> 00:00:49.596
"Tell me how it hurts, Gub-Gub," Dr. Dolittle gently asked.

13
00:00:49.597 --> 00:00:58.751
"He’s not sick! He’s just hungry!" barked an angry Jip.

14
00:00:58.752 --> 00:01:03.293
"Jip! Gub-Gub! Stop it!" Polynesia scolded.

15
00:01:03.294 --> 00:01:05.955
"I think all of us need some food."

16
00:01:05.956 --> 00:01:10.470
"But our food sank with the boat," pointed out Dab-Dab.

17
00:01:10.471 --> 00:01:17.315
"We must go into the jungle and find some food," replied Polynesia.

18
00:01:17.316 --> 00:01:21.189
"Chee-Chee, you are the quickest so you must go.

19
00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:25.985
Jip, your sense of danger is the best, so you must go.

20
00:01:25.986 --> 00:01:28.503
Gub-Gub, you must go."

21
00:01:28.504 --> 00:01:31.251
"Why?" Jip asked sharply.

22
00:01:31.252 --> 00:01:34.104
"Because Gub-Gub can smell food the best.

23
00:01:34.105 --> 00:01:38.414
If there is food, he’ll find it."

24
00:01:38.415 --> 00:01:43.126
Chee-Chee, Jip and Gub-Gub bravely walked into the jungle.

25
00:01:43.127 --> 00:01:46.494
"Be careful!" called out Dab-Dab.

26
00:01:46.495 --> 00:01:51.115
"Don’t go too far or you’ll get lost," shouted Dr. Dolittle.

27
00:01:51.116 --> 00:01:53.487
"Don’t worry, Dr. Dolittle!

28
00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:59.980
I’m sure the animals here will help us," Chee-Chee called back.

29
00:01:59.981 --> 00:02:03.512
An hour, and then two hours went by.

30
00:02:03.513 --> 00:02:06.096
The animals didn’t return.

31
00:02:06.097 --> 00:02:11.037
"I hope they’re okay," Dab-Dab looked toward the jungle.

32
00:02:11.038 --> 00:02:13.285
"Look! They must be coming!

33
00:02:13.286 --> 00:02:19.436
Gub-Gub! Chee-Chee! Jip!" quacked the duck.

34
00:02:19.437 --> 00:02:22.045
But it was not their friends.

35
00:02:22.046 --> 00:02:25.503
A tribe of Africans walked out of the jungle.

36
00:02:25.504 --> 00:02:29.368
They carried sharp spears and large shields.

37
00:02:29.369 --> 00:02:34.040
Their leader walked up to Dr. Dolittle.

38
00:02:34.041 --> 00:02:38.322
"Who are you?" the leader asked in a gruff voice.

39
00:02:38.323 --> 00:02:40.322
"My name is John Dolittle.

40
00:02:40.323 --> 00:02:44.072
I’m a doctor," Dr. Dolittle answered.

41
00:02:44.073 --> 00:02:48.263
The leader did not say anything, so the doctor continued.

42
00:02:48.264 --> 00:02:52.229
"I was on my way to help the monkeys in Africa and . . ."

43
00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:56.531
"This is Africa," the leader interrupted.

44
00:02:56.532 --> 00:02:59.387
"Oh, wonderful! Where are the monkeys?

45
00:02:59.388 --> 00:03:02.655
I must go to them at once!" the doctor said.

46
00:03:02.656 --> 00:03:05.167
"NO!" the leader shook his head.

47
00:03:05.168 --> 00:03:09.191
"No? But they need me!" pleaded the doctor.

48
00:03:09.192 --> 00:03:12.019
"NO! This is King Jolliginki’s land.

49
00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:16.873
No stranger is allowed to go through," warned the leader.

50
00:03:16.874 --> 00:03:21.302
"But then, how can I help the monkeys?" asked the doctor.

51
00:03:21.303 --> 00:03:24.489
Just then, Chee-Chee and the others returned.

52
00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:29.454
"We found food! We found food." they cried.

53
00:03:29.455 --> 00:03:35.363
"How dare you steal King Jolliginki’s food!" shouted the leader.

54
00:03:35.364 --> 00:03:39.792
Dr. Dolittle and his animals were taken to King Jolliginki.

55
00:03:39.793 --> 00:03:42.346
Gub-Gub had a banana in his mouth.

56
00:03:42.347 --> 00:03:48.205
"OINK! OIIIIINNKKK! It’s mine! OOOOOIINNNKK!" he snorted.

57
00:03:48.206 --> 00:03:54.232
"Stop your pig squealing or we will have him for dinner," said the leader.

58
00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:58.408
"Gub-Gub, please give the man your banana," said the doctor.

59
00:03:58.409 --> 00:04:02.899
The tribesmen did not understand what Dr. Dolittle was saying.

60
00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.207
To them it sounded like this:

61
00:04:05.208 --> 00:04:10.122
"Gub-Gub, oinky oink oink oinkety oink."

62
00:04:10.123 --> 00:04:12.767
"What did you say?" the leader asked.

63
00:04:12.768 --> 00:04:16.213
"I was talking to my pig," replied Dr. Dolittle.

64
00:04:16.214 --> 00:04:22.755
"Oh, you talk to pigs, do you?" laughed the leader.

65
00:04:22.756 --> 00:04:27.916
"Yes, I can talk to animals," Dr. Dolittle replied proudly.

66
00:04:27.917 --> 00:04:31.099
"Then what am I saying?" asked the leader.

67
00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.012
"OINK snort, oink oink."

68
00:04:33.013 --> 00:04:35.183
"What is the meaning of this?"

69
00:04:35.184 --> 00:04:37.679
a voice boomed out of nowhere.

70
00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:41.791
"WHO are YOU?" the voice boomed louder.

71
00:04:41.792 --> 00:04:50.217
"WHO DARES ENTER THE LAND OF KING JOLLIGINKI?" the voice roared.

